# Soul Enervation's second ability needs a creature card to leave your graveyard. Bot1's graveyard holds only Faithless Looting and
# two Plains when Bot2's Tormod's Crypt exiles it on turn 2: no creature card, no drain. Bot2 then casts its own Faithless Looting,
# discarding its Memnite and Ornithopter, and exiles that graveyard too: the creature cards leave an opponent's graveyard, so the
# Enervation does not trigger. Both players stay at 20. (The positive control, the same exile with creature cards in Bot1's graveyard,
# is soul-enervation-drains-once-when-several-creature-cards-leave-your-graveyard-together.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Soul Enervation
Faithless Looting
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Tormod's Crypt
Tormod's Crypt
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x14

